comment.narrative:
Target partially achieved.
The current target is partially achieved, and the end target is likely to be achieved on time or within an extended (project) period. For LASED II, all 14 SLC sites are connected with all-weather roads (including the Dong site). For LASED III, detailed design was completed in 3 pilot ICs for Connection Roads (1.042km paved and 2.148km unpaved), residential roads (3.547km), and access roads (3.975km), ad the Bidding process is underway.&nbsp;
Year 3, Target 40???????
